e zoo datasets when user has no data","7. Precede every code cell with a markdown cell","8. Present outline before generating","9. Fetch current API documentation","10. Verify after generation","Complete Workflow","Phase 1: Requirements","Phase 2: Design","Phase 3: Generation","Use Write tool"],"name_hint":"fiftyone · 创建 · notebook"},{"path":"skills/fiftyone-dataset-curation/SKILL.md","name":"fiftyone-dataset-curation","description":"End-to-end dataset curation for FiftyOne: inspect schema and quality, audit annotations, analyze class distributions, explore embeddings, find duplicates, create curated subsets, and build train/val/test splits. Works with any computer vision dataset type.","headings":["FiftyOne Dataset Curation","Key Directives","1. Check for a loaded dataset first","2. Set context before any operation","3. Launch App before any brain operator","4. Discover schema before referencing any field","5. Discover operators dynamically","6. Confirm before mutating","7. Keep App open for interactive review","8. Check delegated service before brain operations","9. Always discover plugin names dynamically","10. Generate interactive insights after each phase","Phase -1 — Curation Plan","Curation Plan for <dataset_name>","Phases I will run:","Phases I will SKIP (and why):","What you'll get:","Phase 0 — Dataset Loading (Optional)"],"name_hint":"fiftyone · dataset · curation"},{"path":"skills/fiftyone-dataset-export/SKILL.md","name":"fiftyone-dataset-export","description":"Exports FiftyOne datasets to standard formats (COCO, YOLO, VOC, CVAT, CSV, etc.) and Hugging Face Hub. Use when converting datasets, exporting for training, creating archives, sharing data in specific formats, or publishing datasets to Hugging Face.","headings":["Export FiftyOne Datasets","Key Directives","1. Load and understand the dataset first","2. Confirm export settings with user","3. Match format to label types","4. Use absolute paths","5. Warn about overwriting","Complete Workflow","Step 1: 