se app when done","Workflow","Step 1: Verify Dataset Exists","Step 2: Load Dataset and Review","Step 3: Launch App","Step 4: Discover and Apply Model","Step 5: View Results","Step 6: Clean Up","Model Discovery","Common Use Cases","Use Case 1: Run Object Detection","Verify dataset exists"],"name_hint":"fiftyone · dataset · inference"},{"path":"skills/fiftyone-develop-plugin/SKILL.md","name":"fiftyone-develop-plugin","description":"Develops custom FiftyOne plugins (operators and panels) from scratch. Use when creating plugins, extending FiftyOne with custom operators, building interactive panels, or integrating external APIs.","headings":["Develop FiftyOne Plugins","TL;DR — Read This First","Convention: use underscores in the directory name (e.g. myorg_my_plugin) for shell compatibility","The @org/name URI lives only inside fiftyone.yml — the directory name doesn't need to match","Key Directives","1. Understand before coding","2. Plan before implementing","3. Search existing plugins for patterns","Clone official plugins for reference","Search for similar patterns","4. Test locally before done","Get plugins directory","Develop plugin in plugins directory","5. Test complex logic outside the plugin first","Test independently first","Only then wrap in execute()","6. Iterate on feedback","Terminal 1: Python logs"],"name_hint":"fiftyone · develop · plugin"},{"path":"skills/fiftyone-embeddings-visualization/SKILL.md","name":"fiftyone-embeddings-visualization","description":"Visualizes datasets in 2D using embeddings with UMAP or t-SNE dimensionality reduction. Use when exploring dataset structure, finding clusters, identifying outliers, or understanding data distribution.","headings":["Embeddings Visualization in FiftyOne","Key Directives","1. Set context first","2. Launch FiftyOne App","3. Discover operators dynamically","List all brain operators","Get schema for specific operator","4. Compute embeddings before visualization","5. Close app when done","Complete Workflow","St